Third-party code in src/port/m68k
=================================

This folder is for the Motorola 68000 family (68000 to 68060, CPU32) and
NXP's ColdFire, with the arguments on the stack as GCC passes them.

The two files listed below come from picolibc, copied byte for byte and
never edited. Each carries its notice from mocom software, which allows any
use provided the notices are kept. The other files in this folder belong to
libterae and are under libterae's licence, given at the top of each:
port_memcpy.S and port_memset.S, which are the files assembled,
port_memmove.c and port_memcmp.c, and m68kasm.h and picolibc.h, which stand
in for picolibc's headers of those names. No picolibc header is used.

port_memcpy.S and port_memset.S are checked by assembling them with GNU as
for m68k-elf: see "What is checked" below.


